msgid ""
"Net forecast of superseded PLM revisions that are used up first (phase-out "
"\"use up\"). It is counted in this rule's forecast: the current revision is "
"only replenished for what the old stock does not cover, and a shortage of "
"the old revision is replenished with the current one."
